        "text": "Watch this video carefully and produce detailed notes for a content writer:\n\n1. SUMMARY: 5–7 sentences covering the main message.\n2. KEY POINTS: 5–8 bullet points, each one specific idea or lesson from the video.\n3. QUOTES: 3 short, memorable lines the speaker actually says, with approximate timestamps.\n4. EXAMPLES: any stories, numbers or examples the speaker uses.\n\nOnly include what is actually said or shown in the video. Do not add outside facts or opinions.s in this video?",
