              "id": "8f162af9-d152-4331-ac8d-f8ad68375c72",
              "name": "notes",
              "value": "={{ $json.content.parts[0].text }}\nWatch this video carefully and produce detailed notes for a content writer:\n\n1. SUMMARY: 5–7 sentences covering the main message.\n2. KEY POINTS: 5–8 bullet points.\n3. QUOTES: up to 3 short lines the speaker clearly says, with approximate timestamps. Only include quotes you are confident about.\n4. NUMBERS AND FACTS: list every number or specification, and for each one state its source:\n   - [SPOKEN at mm:ss] if someone says it\n   - [ON SCREEN at mm:ss] if it appears as text or on a product in the video\n   - [DESCRIPTION] if it comes from the video description, product tags or links\n   Do NOT include prices from product links or shopping tags.\n\nStrict rules:\n- Only include what is actually said or shown in the video.\n- Never convert currencies, estimate prices or add typical specifications from general knowledge.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c7e5a6dd-1688-4aa7-b737-1ea8c0a695b0",
              "name": "voice",
              "value": "=Writing style for {{ $('On form submission').first().json['Brand or author name'] }}: - Audience: {{ $('On form submission').first().json['Target audience'] }} - Tone: {{ $('On form submission').first().json['Tone'] }} - Clear, simple English with short sentences; explain any technical term - Practical and specific: use the examples, numbers and quotes from the notes - Never invent facts, statistics, quotes or personal stories - Avoid hype words such as \"revolutionary\", \"game-changer\", \"unlock\" or \"skyrocket\"\n- Only use numbers and prices that appear in the notes' NUMBERS AND FACTS section, exactly as written.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
