        "text": "=Write a LinkedIn post based ONLY on these notes from a video.\n\n{{ $('Brand Voice').item.json.voice }}\n\nNotes:\n{{ $('Brand Voice').item.json.notes }}\n\nLinkedIn rules:\n- First line is a strong hook that makes people click \"see more\" (under 12 words)\n- 150–250 words, short paragraphs of 1–2 sentences, with blank lines between them\n- Include 3 key takeaways as a simple list using \"→\" at the start of each line\n- End with a question that invites comments\n- Add 3–5 relevant hashtags on the last line\n- Plain text only: no Markdown symbols like # or **, because LinkedIn shows them literally",
        "batching": {}
      },
